  <item>
    <title>S1E4：东亚叙事中，我们正在吝啬地爱着彼此丨读金爱烂有感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680af95f7a449ae85892a16e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680af95f7a449ae85892a16e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Apr 2025 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:00:12</a> 韩国作家金爱烂带给我的启迪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">00:02:22</a> 初读《你的夏天还好吗》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">00:03:36</a> “抬起头来，小家伙”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">00:06:53</a> 大小不一的衣服挂在衣柜里，犹如情绪的耻辱墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">00:10:48</a> 在东亚人的叙事中，人对于自己的爱本就吝啬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">00:13:22</a> 不会爱自己，于是对他人的需要也是错位的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">00:16:25</a> 当一段关系走向分别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">00:18:19</a> 残忍的《圣诞特选》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">00:23:01</a> 人在相对贫穷的状态下，钱和爱都无法慷慨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">00:25:25</a> 什么是当下的「相对贫穷」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">00:28:28</a> 韩女文学是一面可以照出苦难的镜子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>HAZLO - Azucares</span></p><span></span><p><span>Black Lipstick Blues - Will Harrison</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡辛束：畅销书作家，自媒体人，户外爱好者。已出版作品有《我想要两颗西柚》《当相爱的人住进一个房间》。不精通任何一个领域，只是热爱所有的可能性，并期待它们的发生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【更多时刻的我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1892542061" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1892542061"><span>@胡辛束</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812?xsec_token=YBNlKXVLXI7XSzoy4UATGwjc-SNtFeW-a00o9gPtAygok=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812&amp;apptime=1739524679&amp;share_id=5f270d7e2bda411eb3b32a2e27d74d03" data-ur