    <title>S1E2：再看《HER》，反思我们到底爱过几次具体的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bea7a105a90dfd0deefe0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bea7a105a90dfd0deefe0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 05:44:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:00:11</a> 时隔十年重看电影《HER》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">00:03:53</a> 西奥多的工作是代写爱意的回信人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">00:10:40</a> 观察路人时，我会想象他们如何深爱着他人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">00:12:54</a> 西奥多和萨曼莎的第一场隔空性爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">00:15:52</a> 关于Deepseek的人机恋指令</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">00:21:16</a> 当你爱上了没有自我意识的AI恋人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">00:23:34</a> 人机恋中不该出现糟糕的性爱替身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">00:25:24</a> 搭载AI的充气娃娃会改变欲望世界吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">00:26:32</a> 萨曼莎的消失与“对话框满之痛”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">00:29:01</a> 爱消失的时候，爱才真正出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">00:31:49</a> 扩展摘读《亲密关系的核心是友谊》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">00:35:08</a> 或许我只爱上过一次具体的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Entrance - I'm So Glad</span></p><span></span><p><span>Karen O,Ezra Koenig - The Moon Song</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡辛束：畅销书作家，自媒体人，户外爱好者。已出版作品有《我想要两颗西柚》《当相爱的人住进一个房间》。不精通任何一个领域，只是热爱所有的可能性，并期待它们的发生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【更多时刻的我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1892542061" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1892542061"><span>@胡辛束</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812?xsec_token=YBNlKXVLXI7XSzoy4UATGwjc-SNtFeW-a00o9gPtAygok=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=Co