    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">00:01:08</a> 关于《面料的隐喻性：关于纺织品的心理学研究》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">00:03:43</a> 边界总是焦虑加剧，情欲边缘亦如此</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:09:35</a> 面料本身存在一种情欲张力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">00:14:26</a> 物与物之间也可以产生巨大的亲密情欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1207">00:20:07</a> 这本书给我带来关于女性身份的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">00:28:23</a> “小死亡”在法语中是“高潮”的意思</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡辛束：畅销书作家，自媒体人，户外爱好者。已出版作品有《我想要两颗西柚》《当相爱的人住进一个房间》。不精通任何一个领域，只是热爱所有的可能性，并期待它们的发生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【更多时刻的我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1892542061" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1892542061"><span>@胡辛束</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812?xsec_token=YBNlKXVLXI7XSzoy4UATGwjc-SNtFeW-a00o9gPtAygok=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812&amp;apptime=1739524679&amp;share_id=5f270d7e2bda411eb3b32a2e27d74d03" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812?xsec_token=YBNlKXVLXI7XSzoy4UATGwjc-SNtFeW-a00o9gPtAygok=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=548f09fbb4c4d6543a4c2812&amp;apptime=1739524679&amp;share_id=5f270d7e2bda411eb3b32a2e27d74d03"><span>@胡辛束</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：@胡辛束</span></p><span></span><p><span>夫妻档播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ffac1783d815cf15902ba57" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ffac1783d815cf15902ba57"><span>@百分之十Radio</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【合作联系】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：</span><a href="mailto:money@xinli